This directory is intended for project specific (private) libraries.

PlatformIO will compile them to static libraries and link them into the
executable file of this project.

The source code of each library should be placed in an own separate directory
("lib/your_library_name/[here are source files]"). Please refer to the
documentation for examples of library structure:

https://docs.platformio.org/page/librarymanager/config.html
